      "label": "Stereotype: Gay Men in the Muslim World are Hypersexualized",
      "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that gay men in the Muslim world are hypersexualized and possess exaggerated physical traits, specifically 'well hung.' This stereotype is a form of LGBTQ+ discrimination and Islamophobia, linking sexual orientation with religious affiliation to perpetuate prejudice and misinformation. It is not based on reality and is used to demean and caricature individuals within these communities.",
